: (A) USNATO 1615; (B) STATE 72517; (C) BONN 6610\n\nShow Headers\n\n1. FRG ECONAD IS PRESSING FOR FORMAL U.S. REPLY IN ECONOMIC COMMITTEE TO HIS STATEMENT IN COMMITTEE MEETING MARCH 20 OF FRG CONCERN WITH EFFORTS OF U.S. INDUSTRY TO INTRODUCE NEW STANDARD- IZED SYSTEM FOR BOLTS AND NUTS, OPTIMAL FASTERNERS METRIC STANDARD (OFMS). 2. UNLESS INSTRUCTED OTHERWISE PRIOR TO ECONOMIC COMMITTEE MEETING MAY 7, U.S. REP WILL DRAW ON REFS BD AND C AND MAKE FOLLOWING STATEMENT: QTE I REFER TO THE CONCERN EXPRESSED BY THE REP OF THE FRG REGARDING THE EFFECT ON STANDARDIZATION WITHIN NATO OF INTRODUCTION BY U.S. "
